"<b>Settings → Time & Language → Language & region</b></li><li>Click <b>Add a "
"language</b> and select your desired language</li><li>Click on the installed "
"language and select <b>Language options</b></li><li>Under <b>Speech</b>, "
"click <b>Download</b> for the speech pack</li></ol><p><b>⚠️ License Note:</b> "
"Crow Translate currently only supports \"Basic voice models\" from Windows "
"TTS. \"Narrator voices\" have licensing restrictions that are incompatible "
"with this application.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<h3>找不到 Windows TTS 嗓音</h3><p>找不到 <b>%1</b> 的 Windows TTS 嗓音。</"
"p><p><b>要安裝額外語言：</b></p><ol><li>開啟 <b>設定 → 時間和語言 → 語言和地"
"區</b></li><li>點擊 <b>新增語言</b> 然後選擇您需要的語言</li><li>點擊剛安裝的"
"語言然後選擇 <b>語言選項</b></li><li>在 <b>語音</b> 下方點擊 <b>下載</b> 取得"
"語音包</li></ol><p><b>⚠️ 關於授權：</b>Crow Translate 目前只支援 Windows TTS "
"的「基礎語音模型」。「講述人語音」的授權限制與本應用程式不相容。</p>"

